<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT-Buy Asia Credit -Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Buy Asia Credit -Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch recommended Asia Credit Plc as a &quot;buy&quot; on Friday because of the Thai firm's impressive third quarter net profit which rose 21.4 percent to 258.1 milion baht ($10.3 million).</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the difficult economic and financial market conditions, ACL chalked up what we consider an impressive 21.4 percent year-on-year rise in third quarter net profit to 258 million baht,&quot; Merrill Lynch said in a new research report.</p>
</text>
